      "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:45:18.425989+00:00",
      "space_id": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b11",
      "text": "Five seconds later the disguise was in a bin and he was just your average joe in the fluero singlet and workboots walkin down the path.",
      "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
